# Allowlist: track only the hooks. Everything else in ~/.claude is runtime
# state (sessions, transcripts, caches) or secrets — never commit it.
# settings.json is deliberately NOT tracked: it currently holds a plaintext
# API key (fallback block). Strip the key first if you ever want it in git.
*
!.gitignore
!hooks/
!hooks/*
!commands/
!commands/*
# Runtime mute flag for the audio channel, not config
hooks/speak.off
